Run

`research/verify_target_c_two_leaf_oo_weight_t18436.py`.

It uses exact `Fraction` arithmetic, Machin bounds for `pi`, integer-square-root radical
enclosures, and alternating-series bounds for `sin`.  The load-bearing margins are

```text
h=.00013 localization margin      > 4.60e-6
low-center aggregate margin       > 2.44e-3
main-interval capacity margin     > 7.08e-6
strong-branch ratio upper          0.78421...
strong-branch threshold            0.83045...
```

No floating-point sign is used in the theorem.

**Disposition:** proof-only structural strengthening. C-II and Level I remain open.
